You can't effectively increase its tameness as a lich.  Before it
develops into a master lich I believe you can retame it, and the Book
of the Dead may work otherwise, but that's generally not an option.

All you can do is keep it close to you at all times.  This will not be
difficult once it kills enough monsters to become a master lich, since
it will then periodically teleport next to you (VERY dangerous if it
casts invisibility on itself and you're caught without invisibility
detection/ESP).  If I were you I'd find a way of changing it into
something else while you still can.  Good luck polymorphing it when
its MR goes over 100.

If you can't do that, abandon it in the mines or something.  It's
going to step on a level teleport trap sooner or later.

